#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:99
#: e626e01378b04f3c835e6387d15faff2
msgid "The R6 pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for all ArduPilot supported receiver protocols, except CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 which require a true UART connection. However, FPort, when connected in this manner, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:101
#: 1efe6d9f8bb546fbbe30c77bdb623efc
msgid "To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 receivers, the R6 pin can also be configured to be used as true UART RX pin for use with bi-directional systems by setting the :ref:`BRD_ALT_CONFIG<BRD_ALT_CONFIG>` to “1” so it becomes the SERIAL6 port's RX input pin."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:103
#: 291e5b1eb31f49278a1c1fea74842022
msgid "With this option, :ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` must be set to \"23\", and:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:105
#: 15f66d5957914cefa5332dac4ce3b4f6
msgid "PPM is not supported."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:107
#: 8bceed6c8db04a29941e4a15a3532c06
msgid "SBUS/DSM/SRXL connects to the R6 pin, but SBUS requires that the :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"3\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:109
#: ee03f25cea784935b1c0f2da44745949
msgid "FPort requires connection to T6 and :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"7\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:111
#: 7a83a2687a714bc999b2046f8affaaf0
msgid "CRSF also requires a T6 connection, in addition to R6, and automatically provides telemetry. Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"0\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:113
#: 00a1a9028dec448eaf350303180c2898
msgid "SRXL2 requires a connection to T6 and automatically provides telemetry.  Set :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` to \"4\"."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-holybro-kakutef7aio.rst:115
#: 7420952b66ac434c94feef1ff196dc5e
msgid "Any UART can be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot also, and is compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for details."
msgstr ""

